note bottom of LOCAL
  The earlier CPU tests cover a prior source
  generation, whose six input hashes changed.
  Static checks on the prepared mode neither
  repeat those numerical tests nor establish
  current CPU or GPU runtime behavior.
end note

note bottom of OPERATOR_PACKET
  Client deadlines request termination;
  they do not prove a physical host stop.
  Cleanup uses only this run's saved
  container ID, and missing evidence
  cannot count as successful removal.
end note

note bottom of LOOKUP
  Reported shell paths do not establish why
  the historical launcher failed before startup.
  The later process launch supplies new evidence,
  but it does not identify the earlier cause.
end note

note bottom of RENEWAL_2
